  "notes": "Refers to the borrowed money itself, viewed from the borrower's side. On a balance sheet it appears as a liability.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {借入金|かりいれきん}を{返済|へんさい}する: to repay borrowings\n- {借入金|かりいれきん}の{残高|ざんだか}: outstanding loan balance\n- {借入金|かりいれきん}が{膨|ふく}らむ: for debt to swell\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {貸付金|かしつけきん}: loaned money — the same money seen from the lender's side\n- {借金|しゃっきん}: debt — the everyday, more casual word",
